  var method=el(h,h.detail,'details','rmd-lc-method');el(h,method,'summary','','Simulation assumptions');
  el(h,method,'p','','Area mode loads per-difficulty density, level dimensions, NumMon/type pools, elite ranges, monster Rarity, group sizes and champion chance from current mod files. NumMon types are selected without replacement (up to 13), including ranged-first selection. Pack sizes include the standard Fallen/Scarab exception. Sparse checks and place-spawn replacements apply. Manual budgets override ordinary kills only.');
  el(h,method,'p','','Elite allocation approximates MonUMin/MonUMax as a sampled unique-unit budget, subtracting preset named uniques already counted. Champions convert using monumod.txt constants and spawn groups of 2–4; unique leaders have 3–6 minions. Champion members consume the budget individually. Elite events replace ordinary density events. Normal elite types use umon pools where present; other difficulties use selected rarity-weighted types. Minions use ordinary loot tables at +3 levels; champions/unique leaders use their own tables and levels. Named-superunique minion ranges come from superuniques.txt, with the difficulty increment when both bounds are nonzero. Placement failures and room-by-room elite allocation remain approximations.');
